sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant ENR as Enrollment
    participant ACAD as Academic Structure
    participant DB as enrollment schema
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant NOT as Notification
    participant ANA as Analytics

    S->>GW: POST /api/enrollment/course-enrollments (Bearer token)
    GW->>GW: verify JWT · rate limit · pick a replica
    GW->>ENR: forward (X-Request-Id)
    ENR->>ACAD: GET offering (service token)
    ACAD-->>ENR: capacity, window, status
    ENR->>DB: BEGIN · seat lock · count · INSERT enrollment + log · COMMIT
    ENR-->>S: 201 ENROLLED (or WAITLISTED)
    ENR-)MQ: enrollment.student-enrolled (after commit)
    MQ-)NOT: notification.events
    NOT->>NOT: dedupe by event id · save notification · push live + email
    MQ-)ANA: analytics.events
    ANA->>ANA: mark dashboards dirty → recompute
